# Example environment variables for ADHD Care Equity Tracker UK.
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is git-ignored) and fill in real values.
#
# Week 1 does not require any secrets — all data sources are open.
# This file exists so future-you and any collaborator know which
# variables the project expects once external API keys are introduced.

# Optional, used later:
# NHS_OPEN_DATA_TOKEN=
# MAPBOX_TOKEN=
